jE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"Sorting text draw calls sounds like a wonderful optimization. But there has to be a simpler way to implement it than this. I find it hard to believe that we need to expose dozens of methods to a public API and add 2000 lines of code to simply allow changing the order that characters are drawn. \n\nI see most of the code is new, which I assume means that it is duplicating old functionality rather than changing how the existing code works. Is it not possible to just replace the existing code and sort by default?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108369#pullrequestreview-3467802003","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108369","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-15T06:55:32Z"}]